<title>USA: Insituform Technologies postpones meeting.</title>
<headline>Insituform Technologies postpones meeting.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTERFIELD, Mo. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insituform Technologies Inc said Tuesday it postponed its annual meeting until October 8 due to an agreement to settle a dispute over corporate governance issues with a group led by two directors.</p>
<p>Under the agreement with a group including directors Jerome Kalishman and Robert Affholder the company will reduce the size of its board to nine from 13 members and eliminate staggered terms for directors, among other things.</p>
<p>The annual meeting had been scheduled for August 18. It was postponed to allow the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission time to approve its new proxy materials, a company spokesman said.</p>
</text>
